e world and player function. I spoke to old friends who had new things to say that added texture to Hyrule and its people. And, I unpacked how its updated controls and detailed art design redefine its old-school combat and puzzle solving for the modern day. This remake isn’t about scope; it’s about depth. The Zelda series is full of old stories, and the Ocarina of Time remake presents itself as a legend retold, with clear theatrical inspirations that have completely changed how I’m approaching it. Previewed by Logan Plant","display_url":"bit.ly/4yhOqDC","end":209,"expanded_url":"https://bit.ly/4yhOqDC","images":[{"height":720,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2110355200179421185/Z9EPDSTx?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1280},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2110355200179421185/Z9EPDSTx?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":186,"status":200,"title":"The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time Remake on Switch 2 is far from a 1:1 remake, instead adding depth and texture that makes this beloved adventure feel instantly fresh.","unwound_url":"https://www.ign.com/articles/the-legend-of-zelda-ocarina-of-time-remake-is-more-different-than-you-think-ign-preview?utm_source=bluesky,threads,twitter","url":"https://t.co/vinVZmc9uL"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/FhCT8DAvTQ","end":233,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/IGN/status/2110355198497468677/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110355195729195008","start":210,"url":"https://t.co/FhCT8DAvTQ"}]},"id":"2110355198497468677","lang":"en","possibly_sensitive":false,"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":43,"impression_count":34211,"like_count":376,"quote_count":11,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":34},"text":"We finally played The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time Remake and found it to be more different from the original than you might think.\n\nCheck out our full hands-on preview impressions: https://t.co/vinVZmc9uL https://t.co/FhCT8DAvTQ","url":"https://x.com/IGN/status/2110355198497468677"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_21